Wands of polymorph are rare.  One in thirty "miscellaneous" items
generated for "weak" (difficulty < 6) monsters will be a polymorph item;
one in six such polymorph items will be a wand of polymorph, the rest
will be potions of polymorph.  A monster's percentage chance of getting a
random miscellaneous item is equal to its difficulty, so only 1 in 20
(or fewer) monsters weak enough to receive a polymorph item will have a
miscellaneous item of any description.

Hence, to get a wand of polymorph, you would (on average) have to kill
(20 * 6 * 30 =) 3600 monsters of difficulty 5.

